      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and well-presented two-bedroom, two-bathroom ground-floor apartment to the market, ideally positioned within the ever-popular Boroimhe development in Swords, Co. Dublin. No. 52 benefits from its own-door entrance and offers well-proportioned living accommodation throughout. This superb property is sure to appeal to a wide range of buyers, including first-time buyers, those looking to trade down and investors alike.\n\nThe location is second to none, situated within easy reach of Swords Main Street and an abundance of local amenities including reputable schools, shops, cafés, parks and sporting facilities. The Pavilions Shopping Centre is within easy reach, while the area is well serviced by public transport. Dublin Airport and the M1 and M50 motorway networks are also readily accessible.\n\nBright and well-laid-out internal living accommodation of c. 64 sq.m comprises entrance hallway, kitchen, spacious living/dining room complete with feature fireplace, two bedrooms, main family bathroom and ensuite. The accommodation consists of one generous double bedroom and one single bedroom, with the master bedroom benefiting from a recently upgraded ensuite.\n\nNo. 52 further benefits from gas-fired central heating, double-glazed windows and ample parking within the development. Management fees are c. 566.76 per annum.\n\nThis is an excellent opportunity for any buyer seeking a well-located ground-floor apartment in one of Swords' most established and sought-after developments. Early viewing is highly advised. Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 832 3302 or 01 541 1455 to arrange a viewing.\n\nKey Features\n• c.64 sq.m\n• BER D1\n• Ground Floor Apartment\n• Own Door Entrance\n• Master Bedroom with Recently Upgraded Ensuite\n• Spacious Living/Dining Room\n• Feature Fireplace\n• Gas Fired Central Heating\n• Double Glazed Windows\n• Ample Parking\n• Management Fees c. 566.76 Per Annum\n• Highly Sought-After Boroimhe Development\n• Close to Swords Main Street and The Pavilions Shopping Centre\n• Easy Access to Dublin Airport, M1 and M50\n• Ideal for First Time Buyers, Downsizers and Investors\n• Viewing Highly Advised"
      },
      {
